{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your partner just moved into a new house, and it turns out there is something really bad going on. All your nightmares become true in a chaotic night, you won't be able to rest for very long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/ouijaGif_wide.gif?t=1745262855\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you a good couple? You'll need to work together and be in perfect harmony or you won't survive. Your connection will determine your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/enchantedGif.gif?t=1745262855\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sleeping will be crucial to save energy and advance the clock faster, but both of you also need to find a key to escape, or you will be buried alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/crossGif_wide.gif?t=1745262855\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local co-op for two players. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play through the network with your friends using Steam Remote Play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play alone too, but it won't be as fun and you may die quick.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An evil Artificial Intelligence  rules over the house, making every night a different experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Store Capsules made by Gonzalo Guastavino (whynotstuff.wns)</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3238310?t=1745262855","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3238310?t=1745262855","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/2cef3ecf2e6e4792e6d27dd120cdda687bf13e43/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745262855","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/2cef3ecf2e6e4792e6d27dd120cdda687bf13e43/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745262855","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3459180,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your partner just moved into a new house, and it turns out there is something really bad going on. All your nightmares become true in a chaotic night, you won't be able to rest for very long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/ouijaGif_wide.gif?t=1745262855\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you a good couple? You'll need to work together and be in perfect harmony or you won't survive. Your connection will determine your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/enchantedGif.gif?t=1745262855\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sleeping will be crucial to save energy and advance the clock faster, bu